{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51024","headline":"五言伤大和上传灯逝[日本] · 思托","name":"五言伤大和上传灯逝[日本]","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上德乘杯渡，金人道已东。\n戒香余散馥，慧炬复流风。\n月隐归灵鹫，珠逃入梵宫。\n神飞生死表，遗教法门中。\n（〖1〗见同前书《唐大和上东征传》。\n诗题下原署曰「日本国传灯沙门思托」。\n〖汪向荣校注本《唐大和上东征传》录此诗题作《五言伤大和上传灯逝日本》，署「传灯沙门释思托」。\n以「日本」二字归诗题，是，今据补。\n思托爲鉴真弟子，《东征传》中多次提及。\n〗余参阅前元开诗附注。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"思托","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51024.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51024","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}